@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"@apollo/client": patch
+---
+
+Await multipart reader cancellation so its rejection is handled by the HTTP link instead of becoming an unhandled promise rejection on unsubscribe. Unexpected cancellation failures continue to propagate through the request's error handling.
