@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"@apollo/client": patch
+---
+
+Initialize nested `@stream` positions when their containing objects arrive as streamed items. Preserve each list's delivered prefix, including when parent and child items arrive in the same response or cached arrays contain stale tails.
